  storyText: "Ines Remembers\n\n\"I was a kid when Bartmoss's viruses ate the Net,\" Ines says. \"After that, the Net was a graveyard. NetWatch built the Wall, and told us everything behind it was a monster.\"\n\n\"Some things are. Not all.\"\n\n1. Go to the uplink."
